helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081C				0	es	Haga clic en el icono \<emph\>Aumentar nivel\</emph\>\<image id=\"img_id5564488\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20172.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5564488\"\>Icono}\</alt\>\</image\> o en el icono \<emph\>Disminuir nivel\</emph\>\<image id=\"img_id3159363\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20173.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159363\"\>Icono\</alt\>\</image\>.				20130618 17:22:18
