helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152708	644			0	es	SUMA SERIES(x;n;m;coeficientes) = coeficiente_1*x^n + coeficiente_2*x^(n+m) + coeficiente_3*x^(n+2m) +...+ coeficiente_i*x^(n+(i-1)m)				20130618 17:22:18
