helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155	28			0	es	Seleccione \<emph\>Documento de Pocket Word - PC de bolsillo\</emph\> y pulse \<emph\>Editar\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	29			0	es	En la lista desplegable de conversiones disponibles seleccione \<emph\>$[officename] Writer \</emph\> y pulse \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958	30			0	es	Repita los pasos 4 y 5 para \<emph\>Pocket Excel Workbook\</emph\> seleccionando \<emph\>$[officename] Calc\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
